          "action": "Show a split screen: separate molecule unit on one side and repeating structure pattern on the other.",
          "visual_type": "comparison_table",
          "on_screen_text": "Not all substances are molecules",
          "source_ids": [
            "verified_chemistry.concepts[3]",
